msgctxt "288"
msgid "Don't Order Anything"
msgstr "Non ordinare nulla"

msgctxt "309"
msgid "Check Out"
msgstr "Conto"

msgctxt "319"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Ordina"

msgctxt "325"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)"
msgstr "(Sono a corto di soldi.)  "

msgctxt "346"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altri oggetti.)"

msgctxt "378"
msgid "(I can't handle any more turtles.)"
msgstr "(Non posso trasportare altre tartarughe.)"

msgctxt "413"
msgid "(I didn't choose anything.)"
msgstr "(Non ho scelto niente.)"

msgctxt "441"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Sono esauriti.)"

msgctxt "461"
msgid "Let's see. That comes to %s."
msgstr "Vediamo un po'. Il totale è %s."

msgctxt "490"
msgid "A best seller. People can't get enough of our boba!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "542"
msgid ""
"Did you know the scent of jasmine can stimulate\n"
"your appetite? There's tons of boba at the bottom."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "641"
msgid ""
"That classic, rich matcha flavor and chewy boba\n"
"makes for the perfect combination."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid ""
"Chocolate and boba: two great tastes that go even\n"
"better together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "791"
msgid ""
"Black tea goes great with boba, and drinking one a\n"
"day will keep you healthy and slim!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "878"
msgid ""
"Freshly squeezed peach juice goes great with boba.\n"
"Pile on the pearls!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "949"
msgid ""
"This refreshing, tropical passion fruit juice is perfect\n"
"for hot days. Add some boba for a truly revitalizing\n"
"experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1071"
msgid ""
"Our original sweet potato smoothie, paired perfectly\n"
"with a mountain of boba."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1149"
msgid ""
"A tasty blend of yogurt and fresh peaches. It's even\n"
"better once you add boba."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"The sour yogurt and sweet mango are a match made\n"
"in heaven. Added boba is the perfect finisher."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "A healthy, nutty drink that goes great with boba."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1374"
msgid ""
"The lychee scent will blow you away, and it only gets\n"
"better once you add boba!"
msgstr ""
